<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov copper cable/wire orders, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov copper cable/wire orders, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese orders and shipments of copper wire and cable rose in November from the same month last year, the Japanese Electric Wire and Cable Makers' Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>The November data were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Nov 96     yr/yr change	Oct 96 (revised)</p>
<p> Orders	  94,300	 +4.8 pct	  95,251  (+5.5 pct)</p>
<p>   Exports	4,500	+12.8 pct	   3,667 (-27.7 pct)</p>
<p> Shipments     91,300	 +0.2 pct	  92,979  (+5.8 pct)</p>
<p>   Constr'n    34,600	 +5.1 pct	  35,402 (+10.2 pct)</p>
<p>   Electrical  23,600	 -5.2 pct	  24,426  (+1.2 pct)</p>
<p>   Elec Power  10,900	 -8.1 pct	  10,812  (-4.5 pct)</p>
<p>   Automobile   6,800	+26.2 pct	   6,207 (+13.9 pct)</p>
<p>   Telecomms    3,200	 -2.4 pct	   3,429 (+19.4 pct)</p>
<p>   Exports	4,500	 +0.7 pct	   3,459 (-22.5 pct)</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
